# Vercel only builds the frontend. Everything the API needs stays out of the
# upload: it makes the deployment small, and it stops Vercel scanning the
# backend's config for "detected" environment variables that mean nothing here
# (QGF_JWT_SECRET belongs to the API host, not to a static bundle).
